# Full AI pressure tuning · a-one-stage CUDA

Retrospective source review · fit-2f3e853153936dd0

Authored interpretation of captured source and receipts. No new training, benchmark, lineage or scientific promotion is implied.

**Method.** C124 is a pressure-only residual predictor with126,542 trained parameters, encoder widths[4, 8, 12, 16], bottleneck24, reversed decoder and1 internal pressure correction pass(es). The fine path uses bias-free linear convolutions, replicated boundaries, average pooling, nearest upsampling, skip concatenation and a global pooled addition. Input is normalized physical residual q=(rho/h)r. Pressure and equation arithmetic use float64 around the float32 CNN. A shape-conditioned positive learned cosine-mode proposal precedes each fine pass and is accepted only if its actual fine-equation residual norm does not increase. The gate does not bound the final neural correction. The model does not advance velocity/tracer or generate simultaneous future physical states.

**Purpose.** Test one internal pressure correction with a larger learned global response:511 non-DC modes0..7 and a3→64 tanh→511 shape head. The fine CNN remains C107’s width. Two adjacent repetitions of each original sampled frame give2,400 optimizer updates and2,400 fine-network forwards, matching the two-stage1,200-update arms’ forward count. This is one pressure solve, not one or more physical future steps.

**Experiment.** Initialize froman explicitly transformed C107-derived checkpoint with its own inventory: ff3bafb6b165ce3d9c41d74eeba2e645e7b4bc4a07c6d1f56ad7f3d822378779. Use2,400 CUDA Adam updates, batch1 and1,600 small and800 larger draws, by repeating each original sampled pair twice; larger draws rotate through32/64/128 cell tiers. The34 captured train-only parents provide68 selected frames at8/16/32 cells per metre, dt1/60s and fluid density1000kg/m³; the domains include rectangular shapes and cubes through128³. Hard-case sampling uses frozen training-only rank weights up to4 and is enabled. The actual head rate multiplier is1, while inherited architecture metadata says 1000; preserve this discrepancy. Fine rate3e-5 falls to1e-5 at update1801; seed2026101907, private sampling seed2026101908 and fixed C53 normalization. The canonical physical loss adds logarithmic final equation feedback and total0.05 earlier-stage feedback where applicable. Inherited auxiliary banks are disabled and both teacher-forward counts are zero. All arms record2,400 actual optimizer-loss CNN forwards; forward-cell counts differ by sampling. These are parent/frame counts, not proof of independent scenes. Trainer held-out evaluations are zero; the evidence wrapper’s historical post-fit consumed pressure probe does not create an independent validation split.

**Observed outcome.** On the same128 original consumed pressure requests, worst mean-free pressure relative L2 is0.048103248086374374, and worst equation relative L2 is0.012876190020669854. C119–C122 range about 0.00752–0.00797 pressure error, C123 reaches0.01583 and C1240.04810. The control has the lowest worst pressure of those four paired arms; the combined arm has the lowest worst equation error among them. The larger redistributed and one-stage graphs do worse on these tails. The common requests cover only small grids at8/16cells per metre and dt1/60s. No larger-grid physical accuracy, complete-generator drift or freshly qualified speed follows from this review.

**Lesson.** Reducing a head learning rate, resampling hard cases, changing channel allocation or increasing global modes does not guarantee better worst pressure error. Pressure-field and equation tails can rank the same four controlled arms differently. Equal CNN-forward counts do not imply equal FLOPs, memory traffic or measured latency when architectures and sampled grids differ. The one-stage accuracy loss is a real same-request result; its saved pressure pass is distinct from multistep physical-time prediction. Keep the old solver epoch and preserve negative outcomes rather than promote an attractive architecture label.

**Reproduction.** The original49-file witness,52 recipe source bindings, recorded twelve fitting-input declarations, exact rehashed initialization, train population, original train/restore recipes and runtime contract are bound below or in this review report. Dataset/input archives are not freshly decoded by this source-only review; clean reproduction must verify and consume their exact original bytes under the pinned old physics contract. Captured recipes include historical CPU deployment probes; follow current GPU-only inference policy via a separately identified execution rather than silently changing an original Run. Opening/importing a project must remain inert. Clean retraining, independent generalization and end-to-end reproduction remain unverified.

